      "reasoning": "The user is asking me to make a Minesweeper game. This is a straightforward request - I should create an HTML file with a Minesweeper game. Let me think about what to include:\n\n1. A grid of cells\n2. Hidden mines\n3. Numbers showing adjacent mines\n4. Left click to reveal, right click to flag\n5. Win/lose conditions\n6. Timer and mine counter\n\nI'll create a self-contained HTML file with inline CSS and JS. Let me write it to the user's work area.\n\nLet me check where to save it - the task location is /BASE/sales «Продажи» [$structure]. I'll save it there or in a more appropriate location. Actually, let me just save it in the current task location.\n\nLet me create a nice Minesweeper game with:\n- Classic 9x9 grid with 10 mines (beginner)\n- Difficulty selector (beginner/intermediate/expert)\n- Timer\n- Mine counter\n- Right-click to flag\n- First click is always safe (no mine on first click)\n- Flood fill for empty cells\n- Win/lose detection\n- Nice styling\n\nI'll write it as a single HTML file.\n",
